                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "59 years ago, Medicare and Medicaid were signed into law \u2013 and marked the most significant expansion of health care for low-income, disabled, and most-vulnerable Americans and seniors. Today, extreme MAGA Republicans are working callously to slash funding for critical services and cut these vital programs all together.\n\n@HouseDemocrats remain committed to protecting Medicare and Medicaid and upholding the promise of affordable health care for those who need it most.",
