                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Charlotte, who dedicated her career to serving Camarillo\u2019s residents as a former Mayor and member of the City Council, reached out to my office after experiencing difficulties accessing with her Medicare benefits from the Social Security Administration (SSA). After repeatedly contacting SSA for over 15 months trying to resolve the issue, Charlotte called my office and brought this case to my attention. My staff promptly filed an inquiry with SSA, which informed Charlotte of a discrepancy in her eligibility for coverage. Within a matter of days, SSA corrected the problem, restored Charlotte's benefits, and issued a refund for the excess premiums she had paid out-of-pocket.",
