                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "From imposing a nationwide ban on abortion to curbing voting rights to gutting Social Security and Medicare, Trump\u2019s Project 2025 is an extremist MAGA Republican manifesto that pledges an egregious assault on our freedoms, our economy, and our democracy.\n\nI urge my colleagues on the other side of the aisle to reassess their priorities \u2013 and prioritize the interests of the American people over the interests of the former President.",
