                "text": "What does closing the wage gap for one year look like for Latinas?   \n\ud83d\uded2 37 months of food\n\ud83d\udc76 32 months of child care\n\ud83c\udfe0 16 months of mortgage & utilities\n\u2695\ufe0f 19 months of health-insurance premiums",
