                "text": "Because of improvements Democrats made to Medicare:\n\u2705 Seniors with diabetes can save hundreds of dollars a month because the price of insulin is capped at $35 a month.\n\u2705 Recommended vaccines like the shingles vaccine are now free for seniors.\n\u2705 Out-of-pocket prescription costs for seniors are now capped at $2,000 a year.\n\nTo see your coverage options this Medicate Open Enrollment period, visit \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/xHOO5pZKC5",
