                "text": "Today, I was pleased to vote for the Elizabeth Dole 21st Century Veterans Healthcare and Benefits Improvement Act, a transformational bill which includes legislation I authored to improve and expand home- and community-based services for disabled or aging veterans, their families, and their caregivers.\nhttps://t.co/qg9yUHq4WV",
