                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am so pleased to see the Elizabeth Dole 21st Century Veterans Healthcare and Benefits Improvement Act headed to President Biden's desk. This transformative bill represents the largest expansion of VA long-term care in decades, with its centerpiece being my legislation to expand home- and community-based services for disabled and aging veterans.",
