                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "While the threat of Republican extremism seeks to undermine our progress, House Democrats are undeterred in our mission to safeguard the freedoms entitled to all Americans, combat the climate crisis, protect our healthcare system, and make the American Dream affordable, accessible, and equitable for all.",
