                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Donald Trump and Republicans are ramming through the largest Medicaid cut in history \u2013 nearly $1 trillion \u2013 to bankroll tax breaks for billionaires like Elon Musk and their corporate cronies.\n\nThis Republican scheme will rip health care away from tens of millions, drive up costs for millions more, and dismantle Medicaid for the 80 million Americans who rely on it \u2013 including over 204,000 people across #VenturaCounty and the Conejo Valley. Instead of making the wealthy pay their fair share, Republicans are shifting the burden of this egregious tax giveaway onto working families.\n\nEvery American deserves affordable, quality health care. That\u2019s why I will never stop fighting to protect Medicaid.",
                "text_lang": "en",
