                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I was joined by Dr. Gagan Pawar, CEO of Clinicas del Camino Real, Inc., and Jenna Tosh, CEO of Planned Parenthood California Central Coast, to denounce the Republican proposal for the largest Medicaid cuts in history \u2013 jeopardizing care for millions, including over 200,000 Ventura County residents.\n\nMedicaid is a cornerstone of our commitment to providing healthcare to those who need it most. Every American deserves access to timely, affordable, high-quality care. That is why I will never stop fighting to protect Medicaid \u2013 for our children, for our seniors, and for everyone who depends on it.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
