                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The American people have spoken loud and clear: the Republican budget is a disaster.\n\nTonight, we stopped House Republicans\u2019 reckless tax scheme \u2013 one that would defund Medicaid, slash nutrition assistance, and make life harder for millions of Americans, all to bankroll tax breaks for the ultra-wealthy.\n\nRepublicans are feeling the pressure \u2013 but we must keep up the fight. @HouseDemocrats are standing strong to protect the American people and put working families first.",
