                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The proposed Republican budget slashes more than $1 trillion from Medicaid and food assistance \u2013 essential programs that millions of Americans rely on every day.  \n\nFamilies in #VenturaCounty and across the country simply cannot afford these cuts, which would drive up costs and deny access to life-saving health care and basic food assistance. Several Republicans have said they oppose these cuts. If that is true, now is the time for them to prove it. They should join @HouseDemocrats in forcing an up-or-down vote to protect these vital programs.\nhttps://t.co/SBEL01ZTn5",
